Package: distributionzoo
Title: The Distribution Zoo
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ben", "Lambert", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Fergus", "Cooper", role = "aut"))
Description: A Shiny app to view distribution properties and access dynamic
    code in R, Python, Matlab, Mathematica, Julia, C++ and Stan. This
    DESCRIPTION exists to declare dependencies so that continuous integration
    can install the R packages and system libraries the app and its test
    suite need; the app itself is run from App-1/.
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    shiny,
    purrr,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    LaplacesDemon,
    actuar,
    logitnorm,
    mvtnorm,
    reshape
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
